RNA-seq QC COMMANDS
Samples: Cancer1-3 and Control1-3
Paired-end FASTQ files
Run these commands from the folder containing the FASTQ files.

============================================================
1. CREATE OUTPUT DIRECTORIES
============================================================

mkdir -p QC/raw_fastqc QC/raw_falco QC/trimmed_fastqc QC/trimmed_falco QC/multiqc trimmed

============================================================
2. FASTQC - RAW READS
============================================================

fastqc Cancer1_R1.fastq.gz Cancer1_R2.fastq.gz -o QC/raw_fastqc -t 4
fastqc Cancer2_R1.fastq.gz Cancer2_R2.fastq.gz -o QC/raw_fastqc -t 4
fastqc Cancer3_R1.fastq.gz Cancer3_R2.fastq.gz -o QC/raw_fastqc -t 4
fastqc Control1_R1.fastq.gz Control1_R2.fastq.gz -o QC/raw_fastqc -t 4
fastqc Control2_R1.fastq.gz Control2_R2.fastq.gz -o QC/raw_fastqc -t 4
fastqc Control3_R1.fastq.gz Control3_R2.fastq.gz -o QC/raw_fastqc -t 4

============================================================
3. FALCO - RAW READS
============================================================

falco -o QC/raw_falco Cancer1_R1.fastq.gz Cancer1_R2.fastq.gz
falco -o QC/raw_falco Cancer2_R1.fastq.gz Cancer2_R2.fastq.gz
falco -o QC/raw_falco Cancer3_R1.fastq.gz Cancer3_R2.fastq.gz
falco -o QC/raw_falco Control1_R1.fastq.gz Control1_R2.fastq.gz
falco -o QC/raw_falco Control2_R1.fastq.gz Control2_R2.fastq.gz
falco -o QC/raw_falco Control3_R1.fastq.gz Control3_R2.fastq.gz

============================================================
4. FASTP - TRIMMING AND QUALITY FILTERING
============================================================

fastp -i Cancer1_R1.fastq.gz -I Cancer1_R2.fastq.gz -o trimmed/Cancer1_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz -O trimmed/Cancer1_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz --detect_adapter_for_pe -l 50 -w 4 -j trimmed/Cancer1.fastp.json -h trimmed/Cancer1.fastp.html

fastp -i Cancer2_R1.fastq.gz -I Cancer2_R2.fastq.gz -o trimmed/Cancer2_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz -O trimmed/Cancer2_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz --detect_adapter_for_pe -l 50 -w 4 -j trimmed/Cancer2.fastp.json -h trimmed/Cancer2.fastp.html

fastp -i Cancer3_R1.fastq.gz -I Cancer3_R2.fastq.gz -o trimmed/Cancer3_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz -O trimmed/Cancer3_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz --detect_adapter_for_pe -l 50 -w 4 -j trimmed/Cancer3.fastp.json -h trimmed/Cancer3.fastp.html

fastp -i Control1_R1.fastq.gz -I Control1_R2.fastq.gz -o trimmed/Control1_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz -O trimmed/Control1_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz --detect_adapter_for_pe -l 50 -w 4 -j trimmed/Control1.fastp.json -h trimmed/Control1.fastp.html

fastp -i Control2_R1.fastq.gz -I Control2_R2.fastq.gz -o trimmed/Control2_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz -O trimmed/Control2_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz --detect_adapter_for_pe -l 50 -w 4 -j trimmed/Control2.fastp.json -h trimmed/Control2.fastp.html

fastp -i Control3_R1.fastq.gz -I Control3_R2.fastq.gz -o trimmed/Control3_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz -O trimmed/Control3_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz --detect_adapter_for_pe -l 50 -w 4 -j trimmed/Control3.fastp.json -h trimmed/Control3.fastp.html

============================================================
5. FASTQC - TRIMMED READS
============================================================

fastqc trimmed/Cancer1_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz trimmed/Cancer1_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz -o QC/trimmed_fastqc -t 4
fastqc trimmed/Cancer2_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz trimmed/Cancer2_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz -o QC/trimmed_fastqc -t 4
fastqc trimmed/Cancer3_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz trimmed/Cancer3_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz -o QC/trimmed_fastqc -t 4
fastqc trimmed/Control1_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz trimmed/Control1_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz -o QC/trimmed_fastqc -t 4
fastqc trimmed/Control2_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz trimmed/Control2_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz -o QC/trimmed_fastqc -t 4
fastqc trimmed/Control3_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz trimmed/Control3_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz -o QC/trimmed_fastqc -t 4

============================================================
6. FALCO - TRIMMED READS
============================================================

falco -o QC/trimmed_falco trimmed/Cancer1_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz trimmed/Cancer1_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz
falco -o QC/trimmed_falco trimmed/Cancer2_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz trimmed/Cancer2_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz
falco -o QC/trimmed_falco trimmed/Cancer3_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz trimmed/Cancer3_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz
falco -o QC/trimmed_falco trimmed/Control1_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz trimmed/Control1_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz
falco -o QC/trimmed_falco trimmed/Control2_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz trimmed/Control2_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz
falco -o QC/trimmed_falco trimmed/Control3_R1.trimmed.fastq.gz trimmed/Control3_R2.trimmed.fastq.gz

============================================================
7. MULTIQC - COMBINE QC REPORTS
============================================================

multiqc QC/raw_fastqc QC/raw_falco QC/trimmed_fastqc QC/trimmed_falco trimmed -o QC/multiqc

============================================================
8. IMPORTANT OUTPUTS
============================================================

Raw FastQC:
QC/raw_fastqc/

Raw Falco:
QC/raw_falco/

Trimmed FASTQ:
trimmed/

Trimmed FastQC:
QC/trimmed_fastqc/

Trimmed Falco:
QC/trimmed_falco/

MultiQC:
QC/multiqc/

The trimmed FASTQ files will be used for the next HISAT2 alignment step.

Workflow:
Raw FASTQ
  -> FastQC + Falco
  -> fastp
  -> Trimmed FASTQ
  -> FastQC + Falco
  -> MultiQC
  -> HISAT2
